### p7 (Sec.7):
We have implemented DESCRY in a software tool built upon a
number of open-source platforms. Specifically, our static program
analysis for mapping log messages to program statements was implemented in LLVM [1], our log-guided symbolic execution was
implemented using KLEE [5], and our interleaving schedule generator was implemented using the Simics Virtual Platform [8].
### p8 (Sec.7.2):
